        },
        {
            "id": "0eec9ba1-b565-4e17-819d-949bd8480165",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "0d2edd26-5554-47f2-b61f-99a5a0caf64b",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2029",
            "content": {
                "en": "Dad, look! This one can bend backward like this. That's so cool!",
                "zh": "爸爸！你看这个可以从后面弯过去，好厉害啊！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 510.6666564941406,
            "positionY": 364.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "2f978e8e-7505-4b79-b2e1-405342ea22ca",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2030",
            "content": {
                "en": "(The boy is playing with a strange puppet that looks quite similar to what he turned into earlier.)",
                "zh": "（男孩玩弄着诡异的木偶，跟他刚才变成的样子颇有相似。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 886.6666870117188,
            "positionY": 364.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0e6cd887-5e6b-4094-a8eb-3df7424ccb9d",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2031",
            "content": {
                "en": "I've never seen a puppet in this style before. May I ask where you bought it?",
                "zh": "我从来没有见过这种样式的木偶呢？请问你们是在哪里买到的呢？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1234.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 364.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9d8e9aa0-93c7-47e4-84ee-403380b91ade",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "0d2edd26-5554-47f2-b61f-99a5a0caf64b",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2032",
            "content": {
                "en": "Someone gave it to me! I had it with me even before we left for the trip!",
                "zh": "这是别人送给我的！出去玩之前我就带在身上了！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1618.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 364.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0511f7d5-4333-4cf8-8256-d26983c47fe3",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2034",
            "content": {
                "en": "Sigh, honestly, I wish he hadn't accepted that puppet. Those people in cloaks were really too strange.",
                "zh": "唉，我其实不希望他收下那个木偶的，那些穿着斗篷的人实在太奇怪了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2014.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 364.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c7a4d7ad-5d3c-41ef-af79-688a912ca11d",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "3d251560-306a-4584-8903-bebe74011bfc",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2035",
            "content": {
                "en": "People in cloaks?",
                "zh": "穿着斗篷的人？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2358.666748046875,
            "positionY": 360.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "44c2f83c-0f01-4892-8bef-a420936a4867",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2037",
            "content": {
                "en": "About this \"<color=orange>Troupe Elysium</color>.\" Would you mind telling me more about them?",
                "zh": "关于这个“<color=orange>极乐戏团</color>”，您方便告诉我一些关于他们的事吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4551.3330078125,
            "positionY": 217.33334350585938,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "c53927c3-c77c-4e2f-8953-f20a86ed29da",
                    "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
                    "targetSceneName": "Level2-1",
                    "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
                    "methodName": "SetInfoPass1True",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                }
            ],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "2eaa9554-ed28-4983-85ee-e36b153ad33e",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2038",
            "content": {
                "en": "Sorry to bother you, but may I ask what<color=orange> festival</color> you were talking about earlier?",
                "zh": "不好意思，请问您之前提到的<color=orange>大会</color>是指什么呢？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4541.3330078125,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "c53927c3-c77c-4e2f-8953-f20a86ed29da",
                    "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
                    "targetSceneName": "Level2-1",
                    "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
                    "methodName": "SetInfoPass2True",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                }
            ],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "03a08ebb-ba38-46ff-855a-3d7cd0a64754",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2039",
            "content": {
                "en": "Don’t mention it, dear. You’re not from Yuntai, are you?",
                "zh": "别客气，小姑娘你不是芸台本地人吧？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4528.0,
            "positionY": 1296.6666259765625,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "c53927c3-c77c-4e2f-8953-f20a86ed29da",
                    "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
                    "targetSceneName": "Level2-1",
                    "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
                    "methodName": "SetInfoPass3True",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                }
            ],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0df8024f-669c-4680-ba93-aa00b27a9f01",
            "index": 11,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2040",
            "content": {
                "en": "Oh dear, kids your age really do love mysterious groups like that, huh?",
                "zh": "哎呀，你们这个年纪的孩子果然会对这种神秘团体感兴趣呢~",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4896.66650390625,
            "positionY": 242.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "ea70856c-866b-4cf5-8a56-f568728b5e65",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2047",
            "content": {
                "en": "Those people looked way too suspicious. If <color=orange>Noema, the well-known ritual leader</color> in the city, weren’t involved, there’s no way this child would’ve been allowed to take their gift.",
                "zh": "那些人看起来实在太可疑了，要不是他们的<color=orange>祭祀</color>是市里远闻名的<color=orange>沈梦之</color>，我绝对不会让这孩子收下他们的礼物的。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5698.0,
            "positionY": 233.33334350585938,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "32eeb0a5-1562-4a06-9f87-73c14a16c9da",
            "index": 13,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2049",
            "content": {
                "en": "You don't know about it? The <color=orange>Qiqiao Festival</color> in Yuntai is held once every two years! It's a citywide celebration unique to Yuntai.",
                "zh": "你不知道吗？芸台每两年一届的<color=orange>乞巧大会</color>啊！那可是芸台特有的，城市级别的盛会。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4890.66650390625,
            "positionY": 744.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "888cb919-4346-47f1-a31f-dcdb03f55726",
            "index": 14,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2049a",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Sounds like this is the event Noema invited me here for.)",
                "zh": "（听起来这就是沈梦之邀我来参与的大会）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5580.0,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "fda8e819-fa1f-4e87-968a-bdfeaef6f61b",
            "index": 15,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2049f",
            "content": {
                "en": "I heard that many of the new arrangements and procedures for this year's festival were personally drafted by Noema.",
                "zh": "我听人说，这次大会里不少新的安排和流程，都是市里远闻名的祭祀沈梦之亲自起草的。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5956.0,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "87470ae2-27fc-4efd-bb8e-c1c12a88d50f",
            "index": 16,
            "characterId": "318c68cb-5927-41a5-91bd-bf8aa614ee91",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2049g",
            "content": {
                "en": "Getting all those elders in charge to approve of it couldn't have been easy.",
                "zh": "能让上面那些老人都点头，可不简单。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6318.0,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f5430c64-1bf8-489c-92f5-58669836ae91",
            "index": 17,
            "characterId": "0d2edd26-5554-47f2-b61f-99a5a0caf64b",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2050",
            "content": {
                "en": "It's really a lot of fun! Since we're getting back today, we'll make it just in time for the festival's official opening tomorrow!",
                "zh": "真的特别好玩！我们今天回去，正好能赶上明天大会正式开幕呢！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6720.0,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "702a9086-23cb-4748-9ec9-a8bd92b04ec2",
            "index": 18,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2052",
            "content": {
                "en": "(<color=orange>Noema... the new ritual officiant? And also the one behind the festival plans?</color>)",
                "zh": "（<color=orange>沈梦之……新祭司？还是大会的起草人？</color>）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7097.3330078125,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "02a131c3-27c7-4640-a6b7-967b2bf90aeb",
            "index": 19,
            "characterId": "547590f1-5207-4943-a81f-41ae946214ce",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2053",
            "content": {
                "en": "I think I've heard of the Qiqiao Festival before. Doesn't Yuntai have a tradition of worshipping the Double Stars?",
                "zh": "乞巧节我似乎有印象，芸台是有拜双星的传统吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7440.0,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "60fdcb60-2edb-462f-b15c-3f1380831fe7",
            "index": 20,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2055",
            "content": {
                "en": "Ah, Yuntai's Qiqiao Festival doesn't include the star-worship ritual anymore~ But there still seem to be plenty of people who worship <color=orange>Xi Mu</color>.",
                "zh": "啊，芸台现在的乞巧大会已经没有拜星环节啦~不过拜<color=orange>喜母</color>的人似乎还是有很多的。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8133.3330078125,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "8c50eeb8-f34e-4405-9fd3-f2707016a461",
            "index": 21,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2058",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Xi Mu? Douqiao?Noema? There’s still more to ask about, but they’ve already been bothered long enough. Better leave it here for now.)",
                "zh": "（喜母？斗巧？沈梦之？虽然很想再了解一些内容，但已经打扰他们太久了，就先到这里吧。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8814.0,
            "positionY": 742.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "02651c1e-be9d-46c9-9cc1-b817e9aeef45",
