        {
            "id": "a11f855e-87e6-4c47-badf-3bcfd8ba12cf",
            "index": 28,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2066",
            "content": {
                "en": "Probably about half a month ago. Since then, people from ”Troupe Elysium“ have been promoting it all over the city.",
                "zh": "从大概半个月前开始吧，芸台市里“极乐戏团”成员的人一直在市区各种地方进行宣传。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2702.0,
            "positionY": 360.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "cbd7a84b-da17-458d-902b-405ab958e7c4",
            "index": 29,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2068",
            "content": {
                "en": "One day after school, we ran into them handing out free merch on the street. He really liked one of the puppets.",
                "zh": "我带这孩子放学回家的时候，正好碰上他们在路边发放免费的周边，这孩子特别喜欢其中的木偶。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3164.666748046875,
            "positionY": 356.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "7c8aee80-238b-4016-917b-54ab5390b1cd",
            "index": 30,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2046",
            "content": {
                "en": "I’ve seen them around, handing out merch and giving talks on the street, but all the members I’ve come across were <color=orange>wearing masks and those long cloaks with hoods</color>.",
                "zh": "虽然经常能见到他们的成员在路边发放周边和进行宣讲活动，但是我见过的所有成员都<color=orange>带着面具，穿着带有兜帽的长袍</color>。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5308.0,
            "positionY": 238.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "5585f0d2-50b7-43bc-a8ee-07ff6063aa38",
            "index": 31,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2049b",
            "content": {
                "en": "And I heard this year's festival is very different from the previous ones. They've added a lot of new events and exhibition areas, and the scale is bigger than ever before.",
                "zh": "而且听说这一届和往年很不一样，新增了好多流程和展区，阵仗比以前都大。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5234.66650390625,
            "positionY": 744.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0a910f2e-4e62-4a54-8a11-c308a19aa67f",
            "index": 32,
            "characterId": "3d45c290-c43f-4868-8131-241d597b548c",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2054",
            "content": {
                "en": "The Double Stars?",
                "zh": "双星？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7786.66650390625,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c2dede75-e955-4826-b87d-e4a6610303ce",
            "index": 33,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2060a",
            "content": {
                "en": "Hope you enjoy your visit. But did you know that every time the grand event is about to start, <color=orange>Yuntai is temporarily lockdown</color> until it ends three days later?",
                "zh": "不过最近几次大会即将召开之际，<color=orange>芸台都会暂时封城</color>直到三日后大会结束，这点你知道吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5624.0,
            "positionY": 1292.6666259765625,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "49e56ac5-2ee1-443a-8d4b-3594c763e7bb",
            "index": 34,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2056",
            "content": {
                "en": "The event still carries on the tradition of <color=orange>Douqiao</color>, which is why Troupe Elysium has been publicizing it so aggressively.",
                "zh": "大会也保留着<color=orange>斗巧</color>的传统，这也是为什么极乐戏团如此大肆宣传。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8474.0,
            "positionY": 739.3333129882813,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "8c52c5bd-4fa7-4d19-b6c2-154985fbc15d",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "7dce9553-65bb-400b-9970-de7217fdd43d",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2028",
            "content": {
                "en": "A cheerful family of three. The meal service hasn’t reached their row yet.",
                "zh": "其乐融融的一家三口，飞机餐还没有发到他们这里。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 124.0,
            "positionY": 364.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        }
